      49.77,
      375.13,
      539.94,
      434.2
    ],
    "text": "(1) NOTICE is hereby given under Section 7 of the Exchange Control Act read with Section 3 of the said Act thatpermission is granted to persons resident in Sri Lanka who maintain Non Resident Foreign Currency Accounts (NRFC),Resident Foreign Currency Accounts (RFC), Resident Non-Nationals\u2019 Foreign Currency Accounts (RNNFC) and ForeignExchange Earners\u2019 Accounts (FEEA) to make payments out of balances lying in above accounts to persons resident outsideSri Lanka to:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.61,
      447.13,
      539.93,
      470.2
    ],
    "text": "(i) acquire securities permitted by the Minister of Finance by Order published in the Government Gazette(Extraordinary) No. 1947/13 dated 29.12.2015 ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.57,
      483.13,
      539.92,
      518.2
    ],
    "text": "(ii) acquire any other asset of capital nature or for current account transactions as per the Operating InstructionsNo. EC/06/94 and guidelines No. EC/D/GL/1994/2 dated 18.03.1994 issued to Authorised Dealers on removalof Exchange Control restrictions on current (non-capital) transactions.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
